            "review_title": "Review at Cua Ngon",
            "review_text": "RFu\nHong Kong, China94 contributions\n0\nAmazing crab feast\nAug 2018 • Family\nThree cheers to this crab restaurant! The tiny eatery provides different kinds of live green crabs. We had salt-baked double skin crabs which is full of soft roe and cooked to perfection! The black-peppered female crab was also tantalizing. The bill was only one-third of Hong Kong price. Highly recommended to all crab addicts!\nWritten August 12, 2018",
